### hello.fl (매우 상세)

파일: `tests/parser-golden/hello.fl`

```
예상:
✓ Line 1: fn hello → FN IDENT
✓ Line 2: input name: string → INPUT IDENT COLON IDENT
✓ Line 3: output string → OUTPUT IDENT
✓ Line 4: intent "인사말" → INTENT STRING
✓ Line 5: return "Hello, " + name → RETURN STRING PLUS IDENT
